<title>USA: USDA adds beverages to West Africa GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA adds beverages to West Africa GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Tuesday said it added nutritional beverage preparations to the commodities available to the West Africa Region under GSM-102.</p>
<p>It said the total fiscal year 1997 allocation for sales to the region remains at $50 million.</p>
